# --- Blanket image block - Mike's real face/room show up in a lot of these
# (camera captures, face pngs, screenshots), so no image gets committed by
# default anywhere in the repo, not just the dirs above. If a real
# documentation screenshot is ever needed, add an explicit
# !path/to/that_one_file.png exception rather than removing this block. ---
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp

